{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/aazj32","slideIndex":2,"text":"Sources and interpretation:\n1) Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI), Annual Survey of Unincorporated Sector Enterprises 2023–24. The report estimates about 7.34 crore establishments in the unincorporated non-agricultural sector (October 2023–September 2024). https://www.mospi.gov.in/sites/default/files/publication_reports/ASUSE_2023_24_Full_Report-L.pdf\n2) NITI Aayog, India’s Booming Gig and Platform Economy (June 2022), estimates 7.7 million gig workers in 2020–21 and projects 23.5 million by 2029–30. It is a dated forecast and includes platform work beyond ClientClause’s likely initial professional-services segment. https://www.niti.gov.in/sites/default/files/2022-06/25th_June_Final_Report_27062022.pdf\nThe figures describe different, potentially overlapping populations. They are market context only, not a calculated addressable market or revenue forecast. Customer acquisition, willingness to pay, and usage frequency remain unvalidated."}
